    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d79-a1">

                <pb facs="0230" n="96" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg96"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    751.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Consul Boyd to Señor Esquivel.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of Cost a Rica</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-09-23"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 23,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: I have the honor to inform you
                    that the national steamer <hi rendition="#italic">Costa Rica</hi>, Capt. Don
                    José Asín, of the line of the Marquis de Campo, arrived at this port on the 6th
                    instant</p>
                <p>She is a beautiful vesael of 4,000 tons register, three masts, new machinery of
                    2,000 <pb facs="0231" n="97" xml:id="pg97"/> horse-power; she employed 53½ days
                    on the voyage fron Antwerp to Panama, subdivided as follows:</p>
                <p>Antwerp to Buenos Ayres, twenty-seven days; Buenos Ayres to Port Coronel, fifteen
                    days; Port Coronel to Panama, eleven and one-half days; notwithstanding bad
                    weather.</p>
                <p>I am pleased to certify that Commander Asín brings all of his documents in order,
                    and upon these conditions she will clear to-day for Champerico, touching on her
                    return at Punta Arenas.</p>
                <p>In congratulating the supreme government upon the inauguration of this line,
                    which is destined to promote development and progress in that republic in its
                    manifold interests,</p>
                <p>I beg, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Samuel Boyd</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
